  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.83,
      "end_seconds": 5.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "hello, take a seat, I'll be with you in a second"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.39,
      "end_seconds": 10.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Hello, thanks for fitting me in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.22,
      "end_seconds": 12.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "What's been worrying you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.64,
      "end_seconds": 19.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "honestly, it's painful periods, and my family pushed me to come"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.31,
      "end_seconds": 24.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.38,
      "end_seconds": 32.21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.83,
      "text": "About... well three days. My sister suggested writing things down but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.24,
      "end_seconds": 43.11,
      "duration_seconds": 8.87,
      "text": "can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.25,
      "end_seconds": 67.78,
      "duration_seconds": 19.53,
      "text": "First two days definitely sets it off. Pretty mild, if I'm being honest. And I've been feeling sick on the first day as well, for about two weeks. I've also had a dull ache in my back, for three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.56,
      "end_seconds": 71.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.55,
      "end_seconds": 76.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "I'd give it a three, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.7,
      "end_seconds": 77.52,
      "duration_seconds": 0.82,
      "text": "mm okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.06,
      "end_seconds": 90.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "did you get bleeding between periods, fever or heavy bleeding?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.32,
      "end_seconds": 93.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "no, none that I've noticed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.73,
      "end_seconds": 98.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "so, any sign of pain with sex?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.81,
      "end_seconds": 102.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "nope, no pain with sex"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.93,
      "end_seconds": 105.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "And your skin any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.96,
      "end_seconds": 109.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "no, skin's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.62,
      "end_seconds": 111.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "How's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.09,
      "end_seconds": 114.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "no, nothing there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.89,
      "end_seconds": 118.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.58,
      "end_seconds": 139.02,
      "duration_seconds": 18.44,
      "text": "I've got an underactive thyroid. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all to be honest. I've had heart failure yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.55,
      "end_seconds": 142.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "okay go on"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.1,
      "end_seconds": 158.76,
      "duration_seconds": 14.66,
      "text": "sorry what was I saying I have arthritis in my knees for about a year uh I've had heart disease yes work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.69,
      "end_seconds": 164.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "And And besides that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.51,
      "end_seconds": 177.38,
      "duration_seconds": 11.87,
      "text": "right so an underactive thyroid and heart failure are already on your record we'll keep that in mind today alright a few questions about your lifestyle now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.14,
      "end_seconds": 193.06,
      "duration_seconds": 14.92,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. My husband and I live above the shop. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.95,
      "end_seconds": 199.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly including from the the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.38,
      "end_seconds": 204.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "I take Eltroxin, every morning for my thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.67,
      "end_seconds": 207.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.57,
      "end_seconds": 225.91,
      "duration_seconds": 16.34,
      "text": "100 micrograms. Actually I take diclofenac 50 milligrams when needed for the joint pain. I'm on aspirin 75 milligrams once a day. Um I take ibuprofen 400 milligrams with food when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.29,
      "end_seconds": 231.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.18,
      "end_seconds": 234.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "my grandmother had dementia"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.33,
      "end_seconds": 238.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.54,
      "end_seconds": 247.59,
      "duration_seconds": 8.05,
      "text": "I was told I'm allergic to to walnuts, but I don't remember what reaction I had"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.1,
      "end_seconds": 252.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 253.08,
      "end_seconds": 265.77,
      "duration_seconds": 12.69,
      "text": "Yes uh I had a triple bypass eight years ago. I've been putting this off for weeks. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.6,
      "end_seconds": 270.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Time for your numbers if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.51,
      "end_seconds": 282.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.49,
      "end_seconds": 307.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 118 over 68 heart rate 78 saturation 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.02,
      "end_seconds": 310.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.67,
      "end_seconds": 315.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "We'll look at it together shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.14,
      "end_seconds": 342.74,
      "duration_seconds": 10.6,
      "text": "let me tell you where I've got to it points towards primary dysmenorrhoea the reason I say that is that the way you describe it fits together"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.7,
      "end_seconds": 346.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Is this serious doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.33,
      "end_seconds": 367.28,
      "duration_seconds": 18.95,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's primary dysmenorrhoea and we'll watch how it goes. Heat gentle exercise and start the tablet at the first sign of pain. Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.75,
      "end_seconds": 370.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "alright I follow"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 372.4,
      "end_seconds": 378.94,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "I'll want another look in three months. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 380.83,
      "end_seconds": 384.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "okay that that makes sense. Thanks for explaining"
    }
  ]
}